2026-07-27T07:58:49.2678479Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:58:49.2679297Z i /tmp/Rtmpce6n93/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:58:49.2679718Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:58:49.2680460Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:58:49.2681054Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:58:49.2681740Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:58:49.2682762Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:58:49.2683537Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:58:49.2924402Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:58:49.3033553Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:58:49.3471438Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:58:49.3623558Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
